      "description": "Master your home loan with our comprehensive EMI calculator guide. Compare SBI, HDFC, and other banks' interest rates for 2026.",
      "excerpt": "Master your home loan with our comprehensive EMI calculator guide. Compare SBI, HDFC, and other banks' interest rates for 2026.",
